#set math.equation(numbering: "(1)")

Typwiki is a knowledge management system built on top of Typst. It allows you to create and manage a personal wiki or knowledge base using Typst's typesetting capabilities.

Check out the #wiki("typwiki-intro")[Typwiki Introduction] page to learn more about Typwiki's features and capabilities.